file caravan/abate.rye one of thirty rungs whose sixty-nine-line body becomes a three-line delegate; lapsing_of widened where private
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh ceiling re-pinned 129600 to 127600, and the header gains the second kind of absentee beside fold Q's
